    <DIV STYLE="break-before: page; margin-top: 6pt"><P STYLE="margin: 0pt">&nbsp;</P></DIV>
    <!-- Field: /Page -->

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="background-color: #FCFCFC"><B><I>Additional
Information</I></B></FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">The Company continues to operate its cellular handsets
and accessories business and now also operates Core&rsquo;s gaming business through its Core subsidiary. For additional information about
Core&rsquo;s business and operations, please see the Company&rsquo;s Form 6-K filed with the SEC on February 26, 2025.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">The Company previously filed updated financial statements
for Core and pro forma financial statements reflecting the combined operations of Siyata Mobile, Inc. and Core. Please see the Company&rsquo;s
Form 6-K filed with the SEC on July 10, 2025.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="background-color: #FCFCFC"><B><I>Press
Release</I></B></FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">Attached as Exhibit 99.1 hereto is a press release
issued by the Company on October 3, 2025 announcing the closing of the Merger, the name change, and the effective date of the
Share Consolidation.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

